      "reasoning": "Now I need to also update the deploy.sh to use the new sitemap structure. Let me check the deploy script - it already calls _refresh_indexing.py, so that should handle it.\n\nNow let me move on to the big parallel tasks. I need to:\n\n1. Fix cookie banners + consent on ALL 109 article pages\n2. Add Datenschutz nav link and footer link to ALL article pages\n3. Add health disclaimers to health-critical articles\n\nThis is too much work to do sequentially. Let me use delegate_task to spawn parallel sub-agents for different article batches.\n\nLet me first categorize articles into health-critical vs non-health, then launch parallel tasks.\n\nActually, let me be strategic. I'll write a comprehensive Python script that does ALL the bulk transformations, then run it. That's faster than sub-agents for file-level transformations.\n\nLet me write a comprehensive bulk fixer script and run it.",
